  "blocks": [
    {
      "box": [
        417.3880615234375,
        24.533021926879883,
        474.3045959472656,
        32.7188720703125
      ],
      "text": "Introduction\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        43.17808532714844,
        57.897865295410156,
        208.9065704345703,
        67.72087097167969
      ],
      "text": "HOW IS IELTS SCORED?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        43.17808532714844,
        85.70191192626953,
        473.0880432128906,
        96.17984008789062
      ],
      "text": "IELTS results are reported on a nine-band scale. In addition to the score for overall language\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        42.85101318359375,
        98.45911407470703,
        472.64306640625,
        135.10549926757812
      ],
      "text": "ability, IELTS provides a score in the form of a profile for each of the four skills (Listening,\nReading, Writing and Speaking). These scores are also reported on a nine-band scale. All\nscores are recorded on the Test Report Form along with details of the candidate’s nationality,\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        42.5239372253418,
        137.384765625,
        471.3345642089844,
        173.70375061035156
      ],
      "text": "first language and date of birth. Each Overall Band Score corresponds to a descriptive\nstatement which gives\na summary of the English-language ability of a candidate classified at\nthat level. The nine bands and their descriptive statements are as follows:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        43.17814636230469,
        197.2452850341797,
        461.03717041015625,
        220.80711364746094
      ],
      "text": "9\nExpert user — Has fully operational command of the language: appropriate, accurate\nand fluent with complete understanding.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        42.85105895996094,
        229.6288604736328,
        470.755615234375,
        266.92913818359375
      ],
      "text": "8\nVery good user— Has fully operational command of the language with only occasional\nunsystematic inaccuracies and inappropriacies. Misunderstandings may occur in\nunfamiliar situations. Handles complex detailed argumentation well.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        43.50528335571289,
        275.42376708984375,
        452.6208801269531,
        313.0511474609375
      ],
      "text": "7\nGood user— Has operational command of the language, though with occasional\ninaccuracies, inappropriacies and misunderstandings in some situations. Generally\nhandles complex language well and understands detailed reasoning.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        43.17817687988281,
        321.5458068847656,
        460.8573913574219,
        358.8457946777344
      ],
      "text": "6\nCompetent user— Has generally effective command of the language despite some\ninaccuracies, inappropriacies and misunderstandings. Can use and understand fairly\ncomplex language, particularly in familiar situations.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        42.85108947753906,
        368.9762878417969,
        458.40740966796875,
        403.003173828125
      ],
      "text": "5\nModest user — Has partial command of the language, coping with overall meaning\nin most situations, though is likely to make many mistakes. Should be able to handle\nbasic communication in own field.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        42.52402877807617,
        413.7898864746094,
        441.1687927246094,
        438.0055847167969
      ],
      "text": "4\nLimited user— Basic competence is limited to familiar situations. Has frequent\nproblems in understanding and expression. Is not able to use complex language.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        42.85113525390625,
        448.1361083984375,
        450.9231872558594,
        471.0433654785156
      ],
      "text": "3\nExtremely limited user — Conveys and understands only general meaning in very\nfamiliar situations. Frequent breakdowns in communication occur.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        42.851165771484375,
        480.1925048828125,
        448.38494873046875,
        492.9624328613281
      ],
      "text": "2\n‘Intermittent user— Has great difficulty understanding spoken and written English.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        43.50540542602539,
        500.1460266113281,
        441.5042419433594,
        522.3971557617188
      ],
      "text": "1.\nNon-user— Essentially has no ability to use the language beyond possibly a few\nisolated words.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        42.85118865966797,
        534.4921875,
        332.9949645996094,
        544.3152465820312
      ],
      "text": "0\n‘Did not attempt the test — Did not answer the questions.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        468.7440185546875,
        661.7366943359375,
        474.2639465332031,
        669.9225463867188
      ],
      "text": "7\n"
    }
  ]
}